# A second Russian story: read it all yourself
subtitle: "Read a ten-sentence Russian story built only from lessons 1–19, with wants, prices, cats and was, hear it line by line, test what you understood, and see what you can do now."
thumb: "band \"Read it all yourself, again\" note \"lessons 11–19, 1 story\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}

## A second Russian story: read it all yourself
level: basic

    glossed s1 "Сего́дня суббо́та. Ма́ша и Том в рестора́не." say_voice b gloss ["today","Saturday","Masha","and","Tom","in","restaurant"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 680 font_size 34 hidden true
    glossed s2 "Рестора́н но́вый и большо́й." say_voice b gloss ["restaurant","new","and","big"] show_gloss after x 500 y 600 font_size 34 hidden true
    glossed s3 "Том хо́чет ко́фе, а Ма́ша хо́чет во́ду." say_voice b gloss ["Tom","wants","coffee","and","Masha","wants","water"] show_gloss after x 500 y 520 font_size 34 hidden true
    glossed s4 "Ко́фе сто́ит сто рубле́й." say_voice b gloss ["coffee","costs","hundred","roubles"] show_gloss after x 500 y 440 font_size 34 hidden true
    glossed s5 "Кто э́то на окне́? Коты́!" say_voice b gloss ["who","this is","on","window","cats"] show_gloss after x 500 y 360 font_size 34 hidden true
    glossed s6 "Ма́ша говори́т: «Мне нра́вятся коты́!»" say_voice b gloss ["Masha","says","to me","please","cats"] show_gloss after x 500 y 280 font_size 34 hidden true
    glossed s7 "Вчера́ Ма́ша была́ на мо́ре. Том то́же был там." say_voice b gloss ["yesterday","Masha","was","at","seaside","Tom","too","was","there"] show_gloss after x 500 y 200 font_size 34 hidden true
    group story members ["s1","s2","s3","s4","s5","s6","s7"] hidden true
